            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hello @cosmosb,\r\n\r\nYour mini.nvim version is too old. The restart functionality was added only [recently](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/commit/d35b6bdac2a6f710afd8afa02a873a9fd0447f61), on the 27th of march.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/cosmosb/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/cosmosb\">@cosmosb</a>,</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Your mini.nvim version is too old. The restart functionality was added only <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/commit/d35b6bdac2a6f710afd8afa02a873a9fd0447f61\">recently</a>, on the 27th of march.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Hello @cosmosb,\nYour mini.nvim version is too old. The restart functionality was added only recently, on the 27th of march.",
